From e56d144e8b8f1ff4a2f87077b7afd8592467449c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:49:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(job-offers): resolve second QA run defects and refine
 wizard inputs

- Salary keeps the range dash until the separator itself is deleted
- Salary keeps the caret position while editing and caps each amount at 9 digits
- Backend rejects salaries above 999.999.999
- Vacancies accept any number and show the 500 limit error until corrected
- Google Maps links must follow an official share or place URL format
- Wizard fields use the sidebar navy for focus and keep red for errors
- Internships disable the salary field and publish it as "A convenir"

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0162UBxebTVK1cF9ijNgmYxy
